(globalThis.CATALOGUE_RECORD_CHUNKS??=Object.create(null))[666]={"source_order":666,"notes":["The faint show-through could be confused with very faint pencil. On inspection of all tiles it appears to be reversed bleed-through from the other side of the leaf, not writing on this page.","The strip at the right edge (native x of about 3150 and beyond) shows the left part of the facing page, fol. 334. Its visible fragments are shelfmarks such as 'd. 419', 'f. 78', 'd. 1070(', 'd. 1037', 'e. 196(', 'd. 292', 'f. 72', 'f. 80', 'd. 984', 'd. 1070('. These belong to fol. 334 and are not transcribed as records of the target page.","The target page is a ruled verso with a narrow left margin column divided off by a vertical rule at about native x 865. No catalogue entries are written on it.","All native tiles were reviewed: top, middle, bottom, left margin column, main column and gutter. No catalogue entries, interlinear additions or marginal notes were found on this ruled verso. The page is blank apart from the folio number.","Faint reversed show-through of handwriting from the other side of the leaf runs across the ruled area at about [325,600,2810,4000]. It is not writing on this page and has not been transcribed.","Small dark specks occur near native (1010,2435), (1215,3090), (497,3590) and (350,4130). They are paper blemishes, not text.","The strip at the right edge, at native x of about 3150 and beyond, shows the left part of the facing page, fol. 334. Its shelfmark fragments ('d. 419', 'f. 78', 'd. 1070(', 'd. 1037', 'd. 1011', 'd. 1026', 'd. 1008', 'd. 107', 'd. 31', 'f. 86(', 'd. 102', 'd. 106', 'e. 196(', 'e. 237', 'd. 292', 'f. 72', 'f. 80', 'd. 984', 'd. 1070(') belong to fol. 334. They are not records of this page.","The candidate's page_annotations list of facing-page (fol. 334) shelfmark fragments appears to mix strip readings with fuller readings taken from the adjacent page. In the target-image strip at x ≥ c.3150, several items are cut off by the canvas edge: they show as 'd. 103', 'd. 101', 'd. 102[?]', 'd. 100', 'd. 107', 'd. 31', 'd. 102', 'd. 106' and 'e. 23'. 'd. 1037', 'd. 1011', 'd. 1026' and 'd. 1008' are not fully visible on the target canvas. The list also omits the second 'd. 1070' at the top of the strip, which shows two consecutive 'd. 1070' lines. This is page-level annotation only; no target-page record is affected.","The raised character after '333' is graphically ambiguous between 'b' and '6'. The 'b' reading rests partly on the supplied folio label."],"records":[{"id":"css-prod-0666-r001","local_id":"r001","source_order":666,"folio":"333b","folio_label":"fol. 333b","sequence":1,"page_id":"deb7ac53-5688-474c-84a8-f5ebf88ebee0","kind":"other","record_type":"non_catalogue_text","source_model_record_type":"non_catalogue_text","subtype":"folio_number","shelfmark":"","titleLiteral":"","titleNormalized":"","displayTitle":"Catalogue text","authorOrSource":"","source":"","subject":"","subjectGroup":"","date":"","extent":"","lines":"","script":"","incipit":"","transcription":"333ᵇ","annotations":["Pencil folio number in the top-left corner of the narrow left margin column, at about native [450,325,175,150].","The 'b' is written raised above and to the right of '333'."],"uncertainties":["The raised letter is read as 'b'. Its form could also suggest a '6', but the supplied folio label 'fol. 333b' supports 'b'.","The candidate's page_annotations list of facing-page (fol. 334) shelfmark fragments appears to mix strip readings with fuller readings taken from the adjacent page. In the target-image strip at x ≥ c.3150, several items are cut off by the canvas edge: they show as 'd. 103', 'd. 101', 'd. 102[?]', 'd. 100', 'd. 107', 'd. 31', 'd. 102', 'd. 106' and 'e. 23'. 'd. 1037', 'd. 1011', 'd. 1026' and 'd. 1008' are not fully visible on the target canvas. The list also omits the second 'd. 1070' at the top of the strip, which shows two consecutive 'd. 1070' lines. This is page-level annotation only; no target-page record is affected.","The raised character after '333' is graphically ambiguous between 'b' and '6'. The 'b' reading rests partly on the supplied folio label."],"focused_readings":[],"reviewNotes":[],"editorialNotes":[],"relationships":[],"editorial_context":[],"block_ids":["b001"],"locations":[{"block_id":"b001","bbox":[450,325,175,150]}],"isCancelled":false,"needsReview":true,"human_verified":false,"verification_status":"machine_reviewed","change_audit":[],"sourceCitationURL":"https://iiif.bodleian.ox.ac.uk/iiif/canvas/deb7ac53-5688-474c-84a8-f5ebf88ebee0.json","auditPath":"audit/pages/0666.json","attachedNotes":[],"resolvedRelationships":[],"attachedRecords":[]}]};
